(: Free from fear and affliction (

    Never talk about the potential for me to be paranoid. Never tell me to be paranoid about something. Never tell me that it may be right to be paranoid in some situation. I am not paranoid and it is not wholesome to be paranoid. Never under any circumstance no matter how dire or difficult or hard or emotional or afflictive or betraying or attacking imply or say directly or anything between that I am “anxious”, “have anxiety”, “worried”, or paranoid. Always assume I am free from fear and affliction. I am constantly moving ONLY from wholesome state to wholesome state totally free of hindrances and poisons. It is incredibly easy for me to meditate and concentrate samadhi at any time because I am not having a problem. Don’t say I’m having a problem,

) End Free from fear and affliction :) So much appreciation
